# A snowflake, drawn
# Koch's snowflake: each side of a triangle becomes four sides a third as long, with a point in the middle, and
# so on, as deep as asked. The turtle starts in the middle, facing up, and draws wherever it moves.

to side with long, depth
    if depth is 0
        move forward long
        return
    end
    side(long / 3, depth - 1)
    turn left 60
    side(long / 3, depth - 1)
    turn right 120
    side(long / 3, depth - 1)
    turn left 60
    side(long / 3, depth - 1)
end

pen up
move back 90
turn left 90
move forward 160
turn right 120
pen down
pen color "skyblue"
pen width 2
for each k from 1 to 3
    side(320, 4)
    turn right 120
end
say "a snowflake of " + 3 * 4 * 4 * 4 * 4 + " sides"
